│     │Track Assignment                                                                                          │─────┘
│     │  :sample assign [TRACK] assigns the loaded sample to a track                                             │─────┐
│     │  :sample replace [TRACK] swaps the track sample and prunes the old reference                             │     │
│     │  :sample unassign [TRACK] clears the track sample and instrument assignment                              │ded  │
│     │  TRACK is 1-based; omitted TRACK means the current track                                                 │     │
│     │  :sample assignments lists track=sample mappings                                                         │     │
